OL,3,ACatherine sees how her charity climb
OL,4,Afunds are helping hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales has
OL,7,Fvisited the hospital where she was
OL,8,Ftreated for cancer after completing a
OL,9,Fcharity climb to help fund a new unit
OL,10,Fthere earlier this year.
OL,12,FCatherine carried out the Three Peaks
OL,13,FChallenge in June, which involves
OL,14,Fclimbing the highest peaks in England,
OL,15,FScotland and Wales within 24 hours, in
OL,16,Faid of the Royal Marsden in London.
OL,18,FThe amount of money she raised has not
OL,19,Fbeen made public, but it will go
OL,20,Ftowards a new unit offering
OL,21,Fcomplementary healing alongside
OL,22,Fclinical care.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
