OL,3,ACatherine sees how her charity climb
OL,4,Afunds are helping hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe princess, who announced she was
OL,7,Freceiving cancer treatment in March
OL,8,F2024, spoke to patients and staff about
OL,9,Fthe importance of support which goes
OL,10,Fbeyond the physical.
